won\'t work since the data I need to scrape is loaded dynamically by JavaScript after the initial page load.\", \"extracted_title\": \"This is frustrating because I need Selenium to handle the JavaScript-rendered content on the pa…\", \"relevance_score\": 4.9, \"batch_item_index\": 12, \"extraction_query\": \"feature request automation\", \"extraction_platform\": \"stack_overflow\"}', '2026-04-26 17:14:32');
